WEBVTT
Language: en

p1-v1-1
00:00:00.016 --> 00:00:04.252
Start with a single image.

p1-v1-2
00:00:04.425 --> 00:00:10.473
Describe it once. Pick a size and seed.

p1-v1-3
00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:16.814
Wake only the models this image needs.

p1-v1-4
00:00:16.974 --> 00:00:23.083
Watch it take shape while it renders.

p1-v1-5
00:00:23.203 --> 00:00:25.862
Every result is a take you can compare.

p1-v1-6
00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:30.097
Save a white-background copy
in the project library.

p2-v2-1
00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:33.905
Turn the image into an opening frame.

p2-v2-2
00:00:34.078 --> 00:00:38.950
One click adds a new video shot.

p2-v2-3
00:00:39.113 --> 00:00:42.553
Describe what happens next.

p3-v2-4
00:00:42.797 --> 00:00:48.606
One render, three GPUs on two machines:
text on DGX Spark, video on RTX 5080.

p3-v2-6
00:00:48.772 --> 00:00:53.529
Live DiT progress, step by step.

p3-v2-7
00:00:53.707 --> 00:00:56.458
Every stage reports its measured time.

p3-v2-8
00:00:56.624 --> 00:01:01.265
The shot opens on your image.
